pported subscription plans in 2022, giving the firm exposure to the advertising market in addition to the subscription fees that have historically accounted for nearly all its revenue.</p><button class=\"linkish\" type=\"button\" data-more>More</button></div><dl class=fields><dt>Industry</dt><dd><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"industry:entertainment\">Entertainment</a></dd><dt>Country</dt><dd><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"country:US\">United States</a></dd></dl><h3 class=\"sub\">Betas</h3><table class=\"cmp \"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"n\">Beta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:1\">S&amp;P 500</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.69</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:2\">Long Treasury yield</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.02</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:3\">US dollar against major currencies</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.28</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:4\">Crude oil price</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.06</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:5\">Semiconductor stocks</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.40</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:6\">Bitcoin</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.05</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 class=\"sub\">Events</h3><table class=\"ifs\"><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>If Yes</th><th>If No</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-k=\"ev:prop:4\"><td><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:4\">China blockades or attacks Taiwan by May 18, 2027</a><div class=\"aside\">Forecast 3.6%</div></td><td><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:swing:prop:4\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$43</span></a></td><td><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:swing:prop:4\"><span class=\"n v gain\">+$2</span></a></td></tr><tr data-k=\"ev:prop:2\"><td><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:2\">An AI industry downturn sets in by May 18, 2027</a><div class=\"aside\">Forecast 16.9%